      "content": "This passage captures three iconic elements of a bustling Zimbabwean market: 'bhero' (bales of affordable clothing), 'mishonga yechivanhu' (traditional herbal tonics and roots), and hardworking young men pushing handcarts ('zvingoro', known locally as 'zvemabara') to transport goods for shoppers.",
      "rule": null
    }
  ],
